      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Veress et al.",
        "AbstractText": "Here, we report two annotated draft genome sequences of Sphingobacterium sp. strains isolated from honey. The genomes of strains 1.A.4 and 1.A.5 show a limited similarity to each other and to genomes of other Sphingobacterium species, indicating that these isolates may represent new species."
